# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository. The project is developed on
# Windows, and files that end up inside Linux containers (compose config,
# shell snippets, Caddyfile) break on CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
